:10,\"duration\":{\"from\":282,\"to\":288},\"libraryTitle\":\"Label\",\"action\":{\"library\":\"H5P.Nil 1.0\",\"params\":{},\"subContentId\":\"6e695d2e-31a1-493e-9f66-0d33e1bfaba4\",\"metadata\":{\"contentType\":\"Label\",\"license\":\"U\"}},\"label\":\"<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\">Jo\\u0161 samo 1 kap i...<\\/p>\\n\",\"pause\":false,\"displayType\":\"button\",\"buttonOnMobile\":false},{\"x\":50.218340611354,\"y\":75.581395348837,\"width\":10,\"height\":10,\"duration\":{\"from\":291,\"to\":296},\"libraryTitle\":\"Label\",\"action\":{\"library\":\"H5P.Nil 1.0\",\"params\":{},\"subContentId\":\"738c01b7-10e0-4ddb-a603-db888f5f8557\",\"metadata\":{\"contentType\":\"Label\",\"license\":\"U\"}},\"label\":\"<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\">... neutralizacija je postignuta.<\\/p>\\n\",\"pause\":false,\"displayType\":\"button\",\"buttonOnMobile\":false},{\"x\":2.1834061135371,\"y\":17.441860465116,\"width\":21.397379912664,\"height\":16.593886462882,\"duration\":{\"from\":298,\"to\":298},\"libraryTitle\":\"Text\",\"action\":{\"library\":\"H5P.Text 1.1\",\"params\":{\"text\":\"<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\">Potrebno je:<\\/p>\\n\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\">1. O\\u010ditati utro\\u0161eni volumen NaOH (jedna crtica na bireti = 0,05 mL).<\\/p>\\n\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\">2. Zapisati faktor korekcije (<em>f <\\/em>), koji je naveden na bireti.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\">3. Provjeriti dobiveni rezultat s voditeljem laboratorijskih vje\\u017ebi.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\">Pritisnite \\u25b6 za nastavak vje\\u017ebe.<\\/p>\\n\"},\"subContentId\":\"653903ed-4742-4c59-ae2e-1358bfabfd4b\",\"metadata\":{\"contentType\":\"Text\",\"license\":\"U\",\"title\":\"Untitled Text\",\"authors\":[],\"changes\":[]}},\"pause\":true,\"displayType\":\"poster\",\"buttonOnMobile\":false,\"visuals\":{\"backgroundColor\":\"rgba(255, 217, 102, 0.779)\",\"boxShadow\":true},\"goto\":{\"url\":{\"protocol\":\"http:\\/\\/\"},\"visualize\":false,\"type\":\"\"},\"label\":\"\"},{\"x\":18.558951965066,\"y\":9.6899224806202,\"width\":23.580786026201,\"height\":4.8034934497817,\"duration\":{\"from\":305,\"to\":315},\"libraryTitle\":\"Text\",\"action\":{\"library\":\"H5P.Text 1.1\",\"params\":{\"text\":\"<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\">Na po\\u010detku drugog dijela vje\\u017ebe, potrebno je izvagati pribli\\u017eno 1 g kalijeva nitrata.<\\/p>\\n\"},\"subContentId\":\"dafdd3f0-0dc9-4e2b-9f63-c6219133359f\",\"metadata\":{\"contentType\":\"Text\",\"license\":\"U\",\"title\":\"Untitled Text\",\"authors\":[],\"changes\":[]}},\"pause\":false,\"displayType\":\"poster\",\"buttonOnMobile\":false,\"visuals\":{\"backgroundColor\":\"rgba(255, 217, 102, 0.797)\",\"boxShadow\":true},\"goto\":{\"url\":{\"protocol\":\"http:\\/\\/\"},\"visualize\":false,\"type\":\"\"},\"label\":\"\"},{\"x\":2.1834061135371,\"y\":48.449612403101,\"width\":26.637554585153,\"height\":9.6069868995633,\"duration\":{\"from\":347,\"to\":357},\"libraryTitle\":\"Text\",\"action\":{\"library\":\"H5P.Text 1.1\",\"params\":{\"text\":\"<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\">Ponovno se odmjeri 100 mL destilirane vode te se ulije u kalorimetar.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\">Kalorimetar se potom zatvori i uz mije\\u0161anje kru\\u017eenjem po podlozi svakih 30 sekundi o\\u010ditava se temperatura do ustaljenja.<\\/p>\\n\"},\"subContentId\":\"8b75b996-3a86-4b7a-98f9-846168782ee1\",\"metadata\":{\"contentType\":\"Text\",\"license\":\"U\",\"title\":\"Untitled Text\",\"authors\":[],\"changes\":[]}},\"pause\":false,\"displayType\":\"poster\",\"buttonOnMobile\":false,\"visuals\":{\"backgroundColor\":\"rgba(255, 217, 102, 0.791)\",\"boxShadow\":true},\"goto\":{\"url\":{\"protocol\":\"http:\\/\\/\"},\"visualize\":false,\"type\":\"\"},\"label\":\"\"},{\"x\":44.759825327511,\"y\":9.6899224806202,\"width\":20.524017467249,\"height\":17.903930131004,\"duration\":{\"from\":362,\"to\":373},\"libraryTitle\":\"Text\",\"action\":{\"library\":\"H5P.Text 1.1\",\"params\":{\"text\":\"<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\">U kalorimetar se dodaje odvaga kalijeva nitrata.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\">Odmah po dodatku soli kalorimetar se zatvori te se, uz stalno mije\\u0161anje, o\\u010ditava temperatura svakih 30 s do ustaljenja.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\">Na po\\u010detku je potrebno jednom malo ja\\u010de promije\\u0161ati otopinu u kalorimetru kako bi se otopila sva sol zaostala na stijenkama.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\">Tijekom dodavanja kalijevog nitrata u kalorimetar ne smije se gasiti \\u0161toperica!<\\/p>\\n\"},\"subContentId\":\"6ea131fa-3390-48f9-8e8a-4cded2f11252\",\"metadata\":{\"contentType\":\"Text\",\"license\":\"U\",\"title\":\"Untitled Text\",\"authors\":[],\"changes\":[]}},\"pause\":false,\"displayType\":\"poster\",\"buttonOnMobile\":false,\"visuals\":{\"backgroundColor\":\"rgba(255, 217, 102, 0.762)\",\"boxShadow\":true},\"goto\":{\"url\":{\"protocol\":\"http:\\/\\/\"},\"visualize\":false,\"type\":\"\"},\"label\":\"\"},{\"x\":24.017467248908,\"y\":25.193798449612,\"width\":20.087336244541,\"height\":10,\"duration\":{\"from\":392,\"to\":396},\"libraryTitle\":\"Text\",\"action\":{\"library\":\"H5P.Text 1.1\",\"params\":{\"text\":\"<h2 style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\">KRAJ<\\/h2>\\n\\n<h2 style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\">Ili? \\ud83e\\udd2d<\\/h2>\\n\"},\"subContentId\":\"fe5294b5-8a37-4d8a-a20f-35677fa485be\",\"metadata\":{\"contentType\":\"Text\",\"license\":\"U\",\"title\":\"Untitled Text\",\"authors\":[],\"changes\":[]}},\"pause\":false,\"displayType\":\"poster\",\"buttonOnMobile\":false,\"visuals\":{\"backgroundColor\":\"rgba(255, 217, 102, 0.744)\",\"boxShadow\":true},\"goto\":{\"url\":{\"protocol\":\"http:\\/\\/\"},\"visualize\":false,\"type\":\"\"},\"label\":\"\"}],\"bookmarks\":[],\"endscreens\":[{\"time\":397,\"label\":\"6:37 Po\\u0161alji zaslon\"}]},\"summary\":{\"task\":{\"library\":\"H5P.Summary 1.10\",\"params\":