: center;\\\">Drago mi je da pratite. Nastavimo dalje...<\\/p>\\n\"},\"subContentId\":\"17228411-6900-4e2d-836f-5195bf0c80e7\",\"metadata\":{\"contentType\":\"Text\",\"license\":\"U\",\"title\":\"Untitled Text\"}},\"pause\":false,\"displayType\":\"poster\",\"buttonOnMobile\":false,\"visuals\":{\"backgroundColor\":\"rgba(255, 217, 102, 0.727)\",\"boxShadow\":true},\"goto\":{\"url\":{\"protocol\":\"http:\\/\\/\"},\"visualize\":false,\"type\":\"\"},\"label\":\"\"},{\"x\":10.917030567686,\"y\":15.503875968992,\"width\":31.877729257642,\"height\":8.7336244541485,\"duration\":{\"from\":195,\"to\":205},\"libraryTitle\":\"Text\",\"action\":{\"library\":\"H5P.Text 1.1\",\"params\":{\"text\":\"<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\">Slijedi uzimanje alikvota od 10 mL trbu\\u0161astom pipetom, koji se zatim stavlja u Erlenmeyerovu tikvicu.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\">NIKAKO se ne smije zaboraviti dodati 1 kap indikatora jer u protivnom promjena obojenja ne\\u0107e biti vidljiva!<\\/p>\\n\"},\"subContentId\":\"ce5d09fb-78ac-4978-807b-668a936b7807\",\"metadata\":{\"contentType\":\"Text\",\"license\":\"U\",\"title\":\"Untitled Text\"}},\"pause\":false,\"displayType\":\"poster\",\"buttonOnMobile\":false,\"visuals\":{\"backgroundColor\":\"rgba(255, 217, 102, 0.75)\",\"boxShadow\":true},\"goto\":{\"url\":{\"protocol\":\"http:\\/\\/\"},\"visualize\":false,\"type\":\"\"},\"label\":\"\"},{\"x\":13.100436681223,\"y\":15.503875968992,\"width\":30.131004366812,\"height\":3.056768558952,\"duration\":{\"from\":230,\"to\":238},\"libraryTitle\":\"Text\",\"action\":{\"library\":\"H5P.Text 1.1\",\"params\":{\"text\":\"<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\">Slijedi titracija i prikaz pravilnog punjenja automatske birete.<\\/p>\\n\"},\"subContentId\":\"76d82bd3-6a87-4a4d-aab4-78f5d7423311\",\"metadata\":{\"contentType\":\"Text\",\"license\":\"U\",\"title\":\"Untitled Text\"}},\"pause\":false,\"displayType\":\"poster\",\"buttonOnMobile\":false,\"visuals\":{\"backgroundColor\":\"rgba(255, 217, 102, 0.744)\",\"boxShadow\":true},\"goto\":{\"url\":{\"protocol\":\"http:\\/\\/\"},\"visualize\":false,\"type\":\"\"},\"label\":\"\"},{\"x\":4.3668122270742,\"y\":13.564410480349,\"width\":19.650655021834,\"height\":13.53711790393,\"duration\":{\"from\":240,\"to\":253},\"libraryTitle\":\"Text\",\"action\":{\"library\":\"H5P.Text 1.1\",\"params\":{\"text\":\"<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\">Postupak:<\\/p>\\n\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\">1. Dr\\u017ei se prst na odu\\u0161ku.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\">2. Gumenom pumpicom stvara se podtlak koji podi\\u017ee razinu otopine do vrha birete.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\">3. Nakon \\u0161to se bireta napunila, otpusti se odu\\u0161ak i bireta se automatski podesi na nulu.<\\/p>\\n\"},\"subContentId\":\"15552718-8cc3-4cc7-8644-0efe960a41cf\",\"metadata\":{\"contentType\":\"Text\",\"license\":\"U\",\"title\":\"Untitled Text\"}},\"pause\":false,\"displayType\":\"poster\",\"buttonOnMobile\":false,\"visuals\":{\"backgroundColor\":\"rgba(255, 217, 102, 0.779)\",\"boxShadow\":true},\"goto\":{\"url\":{\"protocol\":\"http:\\/\\/\"},\"visualize\":false,\"type\":\"\"},\"label\":\"\"},{\"x\":69.868995633188,\"y\":81.395348837209,\"width\":10,\"height\":10,\"duration\":{\"from\":254,\"to\":259},\"libraryTitle\":\"Label\",\"action\":{\"library\":\"H5P.Nil 1.0\",\"params\":{},\"subContentId\":\"f668f7f8-a663-49d8-bb3f-9b2984ea8ba7\",\"metadata\":{\"contentType\":\"Label\",\"license\":\"U\"}},\"label\":\"<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\">Slijedi titracija.<\\/p>\\n\",\"pause\":false,\"displayType\":\"button\",\"buttonOnMobile\":false},{\"x\":3.2751091703057,\"y\":25.193798449612,\"width\":19.213973799127,\"height\":6.5502183406114,\"duration\":{\"from\":262,\"to\":272},\"libraryTitle\":\"Text\",\"action\":{\"library\":\"H5P.Text 1.1\",\"params\":{\"text\":\"<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\">Potrebno je uo\\u010diti trenutak kada jedna kap dovodi do promjene obojenja u postojanu blago ljubi\\u010dastu boju.<\\/p>\\n\"},\"subContentId\":\"7b897382-a033-4167-a1a2-512d4466da43\",\"metadata\":{\"contentType\":\"Text\",\"license\":\"U\",\"title\":\"Untitled Text\"}},\"pause\":false,\"displayType\":\"poster\",\"buttonOnMobile\":false,\"visuals\":{\"backgroundColor\":\"rgba(255, 217, 102, 0.727)\",\"boxShadow\":true},\"goto\":{\"url\":{\"protocol\":\"http:\\/\\/\"},\"visualize\":false,\"type\":\"\"},\"label\":\"\"},{\"x\":57.860262008734,\"y\":67.829457364341,\"width\":10,\"height\":10,\"duration\":{\"from\":282,\"to\":288},\"libraryTitle\":\"Label\",\"action\":{\"library\":\"H5P.Nil 1.0\",\"params\":{},\"subContentId\":\"6e695d2e-31a1-493e-9f66-0d33e1bfaba4\",\"metadata\":{\"contentType\":\"Label\",\"license\":\"U\"}},\"label\":\"<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\">Jo\\u0161 samo 1 kap i...<\\/p>\\n\",\"pause\":false,\"displayType\":\"button\",\"buttonOnMobile\":false},{\"x\":50.218340611354,\"y\":75.581395348837,\"width\":10,\"height\":10,\"duration\":{\"from\":291,\"to\":296},\"libraryTitle\":\"Label\",\"action\":{\"library\":\"H5P.Nil 1.0\",\"params\":{},\"subContentId\":\"738c01b7-10e0-4ddb-a603-db888f5f8557\",\"metadata\":{\"contentType\":\"Label\",\"license\":\"U\"}},\"label\":\"<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\">... neutralizacija je postignuta.<\\/p>\\n\",\"pause\":false,\"displayType\":\"button\",\"buttonOnMobile\":false},{\"x\":2.1834061135371,\"y\":17.441860465116,\"width\":21.397379912664,\"height\":16.593886462882,\"duration\":{\"from\":298,\"to\":298},\"libraryTitle\":\"Text\",\"action\":{\"library\":\"H5P.Text 1.1\",\"params\":{\"text\":\"<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\">Potrebno je:<\\/p>\\n\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\">1. O\\u010ditati utro\\u0161eni volumen NaOH (jedna crtica na bireti = 0,05 mL).<\\/p>\\n\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\">2. Zapisati faktor korekcije (<em>f <\\/em>), koji je naveden na bireti.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\">3. Provjeriti dobiveni rezultat s voditeljem laboratorijskih vje\\u017ebi.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\">Pritisnite \\u25b6 za nastavak vje\\u017ebe.<\\/p>\\n\"},\"subContentId\":\"653903ed-4742-4c59-ae2e-1358bfabfd4b\",\"metadata\":{\"contentType\":\"Text\",\"license\":\"U\",\"title\":\"Untitled Text\"}},\"pause\":true,\"displayType\":\"poster\",\"buttonOnMobile\":false,\"visuals\":{\"backgroundColor\":\"rgba(255, 217, 102, 0.779)\",\"boxShadow\":true},\"goto\":{\"url\":{\"protocol\":\"http:\\/\\/\"},\"visualize\":false,\"type\":\"\"},\"label\":\"\"},{\"x\":18.558951965066,\"y\":9.6899224806202,\"width\":23.580786026201,\"height\":4.8034934497817,\"duration\":{\"from\":305,\"to\":315},\"libraryTitle\":\"Text\",\"action\":{\"library\":\"H5P.Text 1.1\",\"params\":{\"text\":\"<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\">Na po\\u010detku drugog dijela vje\\u017ebe, potrebno je izvagati pribli\\u017eno 1 g kalijeva nitrata.<\\/p>\\n\"},\"subContentId\":\"dafdd3f0-0dc9-4e2b-9f63-c6219133359f\",\"metadata\":{\"contentType\":\"Text\",\"license\":\"U\",\"title\":\"Untitled Text\"}},\"pause\":false,\"displayType\":\"poster\",\"buttonOnMobile\":false,\"visuals\":{\"backgroundColor\":\"rgba(255, 217, 102, 0.797)\",\"boxShadow\":true},\"goto\":{\"url\":{\"protocol\":\"http:\\/\\/\"},\"visualize\":false,\"type\":\"\"},\"label\":\"\"},{\"x\":2.1834061135371,\"y\":48.449612403101,\"width\":26.637554585153,\"height\":9.6069868995633,\"duration\":{\"from\":347,\"to\":357},\"libraryTitle\":\"Text\",\"action\":{\"library\":\"H5P.Text 1.1\",\"params\":{\"text\":\"<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\">Ponovno se odmjeri 100 mL destilirane vode te se ulije u kalorimetar.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\">Kalorimetar se potom zatvori i uz mije\\u0161anje kru\\u017eenjem po podlozi svakih 30 sekundi o\\u010ditava se temperatura do ustaljenja.<\\/p>\\n\"},\"subContentId\":\"8b75b996-3a86-4b7a-98f9-846168782ee1\",\"metadata\":{\"contentType\":\"Text\",\"license\":\"U\",\"title\":\"Untitled Text\"}},\"pause\":false,\"displayType\":\"poster\",\"buttonOnMobile\":false,\"visuals\":{\"backgroundColor\":\"rgba(255, 217, 102, 0.791)\",\"boxShadow\":true},\"goto\":{\"url\":{\"protocol\":\"http:\\/\\/\"},\"visualize\":false,\"type\":\"\"},\"label\":\"\"},{\"x\":44.759825327511,\"y\":9.6899224806202,\"width\":20.524017467249,\"height\":17.903930131004,\"duration\":{\"from\":362,\"to\":373},\"libraryTitle\":\"Text\",\"action\":{\"library\":\"H5P.Text 1.1\",\"params\":{\"text\":\"<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\">U kalorimetar se dodaje odvaga kalijeva nitrata.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\">Odmah po dodatku soli kalorimetar se zatvori te se, uz stalno mije\\u0161anje, o\\u010ditava temperatura svakih 30 s do ustaljenja.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\">Na po\\u010detku je potrebno jednom malo ja\\u010de promije\\u0161ati otopinu u kalorimetru kako bi se otopila sva sol zaostala na stijenkama.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\">Tijekom dodavanja kalijevog nitrata u kalorimetar ne smije se gasiti \\u0161toperica!<\\/p>\\n\"},\"subContentId\":\"6ea131fa-3390-48f9-8e8a-4cded2f11252\",\"metadata\":{\"contentType\":\"Text\",\"license\":\"U\",\"title\":\"Untitled Text\"}},\"pause\":false,\"displayType\":\"poster\",\"buttonOnMobile\":false,\"visuals\":{\"backgroundColor\":\"rgba(255, 217, 102, 0.762)\",\"boxShadow\":true},\"goto\":{\"url\":{\"protocol\":\"http:\\/\\/\"},\"visualize\":false,\"type\":\"\"},\"label\":\"\"},{\"x\":24.017467248908,\"y\":25.193798449612,\"width\":20.087336244541,\"height\":10,\"duration\":{\"from\":392,\"to\":396},\"libraryTitle\":\"Text\",\"action\":{\"library\":\"H5P.Text 1.1\",\"params\":{\"text\":\"<h2 style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\">KRAJ<\\/h2>\\n\\n<h2 style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\">Ili? \\ud83e\\udd2d<\\/h2>\\n\"},\"subContentId\":\"fe5294b5-8a37-4d8a-a20f-35677fa485be\",\"metadata\":{\"contentType\":\"Text\",\"license\":\"U\",\"title\":\"Untitled Text\"}},\"pause\":false,\"displayType\":\"poster\",\"buttonOnMobile\":false,\"visuals\":{\"backgroundColor\":\"rgba(255, 217, 102, 0.744)\",\"boxShadow\":true},\"goto\":{\"url\":{\"protocol\":\"http:\\/\\/\"},\"visualize\":false,\"type\":\"\"},\"label\":\"\"}],\"endscreens\":[{\"time\":397,\"label\":\"6:37 Po\\u0161alji zaslon\"}]},\"summary\":{\"task\":{\"library\":\"H5P.Summary 1.10\",\"params\":{\"intro\":\"<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\">Otapanje kalijevog nitrata u vodi je:<\\/p>\\n\",\"summaries\":[{\"subContentId\":\"817396b6-e300-42bd-b9cc-770e8548cd0f\",\"tip\":\"\",\"summary\":[\"<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\">Endotermna reakcija.<\\/p>\\n\",\"<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\">Egzotermna reakcija.<\\/p>\\n\"]}],\"overallFeedback\":[{\"from\":0,\"to\":100}],\"solvedLabel\":\"Progress:\",\"scoreLabel\":\"Wrong answers:\",\"resultLabel\":\"Your result\",\"labelCorrect\":\"Correct.\",\"labelIncorrect\":\"Incorrect! Please try again.\",\"alternativeIncorrectLabel\":\"Incorrect\",\"labelCorrectAnswers\":\"Correct answers.\",\"tipButtonLabel\":\"Show tip\",\"scoreBarLabel\":\"You got :num out of :total points\",\"progressText\":\"Progress :num of :total\"},\"subContentId\":\"3915b8d3-975b-484c-b2b7-1993a4fa57d0\",\"metadata\":{\"contentType\":\"Summary\",\"license\":\"U\",\"title\":\"Untitled Summary\"}},\"displayAt\":3}},\"override\":{\"autoplay\":false,\"loop\":false,\"showBookmarksmenuOnLoad\":false,\"showRewind10\":false,\"preventSkipping\":false,\"deactivateSound\":false},\"l10n\":{\"interaction\":\"Interaction\",\"play\":\"Pokreni\",\"pause\":\"Pauza\",\"mute\":\"Mute, currently unmuted\",\"unmute\":\"Unmute, currently muted\",\"quality\":\"Video Quality\",\"captions\":\"Titlovi\",\"close\":\"Zatvori\",\"fullscreen\":\"Fullscreen\",\"exitFullscreen\":\"Exit Fullscreen\",\"summary\":\"Pitanje za kraj!\",\"bookmarks\":\"Bookmarks\",\"endscreen\":\"Submit screen\",\"defaultAdaptivitySeekLabel\":\"Nastavi\",\"continueWithVideo\":\"Continue with video\",\"playbackRate\":\"Playback Rate\",\"rewind10\":\"Rewind 10 Seconds\",\"navDisabled\":\"Navigation is disabled\",\"sndDisabled\":\"Sound is disabled\",\"requiresCompletionWarning\":\"You need to answer all the questions correctly before continuing.\",\"back\":\"Back\",\"hours\":\"Sati\",\"minutes\":\"Minute\",\"seconds\":\"Sekunde\",\"currentTime\":\"Trenutno vrijeme:\",\"totalTime\":\"Total time:\",\"singleInteractionAnnouncement\":\"Interaction appeared:\",\"multipleInteractionsAnnouncement\":\"Multiple interactions appeared.\",\"videoPausedAnnouncement\":\"Video is paused\",\"content\":\"Sadr\\u017eaj\",\"answered\":\"@answered answered\",\"endcardTitle\":\"@answered Question(s) answered\",\"endcardInformation\":\"You have answered @answered questions, click below to submit your answers.\",\"endcardInformationNoAnswers\":\"You have not answered any questions.\",\"endcardInformationMustHaveAnswer\":\"You have to answer at least one question before you can submit your answers.\",\"endcardSubmitButton\":\"Submit Answers\",\"endcardSubmitMessage\":\"Your answers have been submitted!\",\"endcardTableRowAnswered\":\"Answered questions\",\"endcardTableRowScore\":\"Score\",\"endcardAnsweredScore\":\"answered\",\"endCardTableRowSummaryWithScore\":\"You got @score out of @total points for the @question that appeared after @minutes minutes and @seconds seconds.\",\"endCardTableRowSummaryWithoutScore\":\"You have answered the @question that appeared after @minutes minutes and @seconds seconds.\"}}','kalorimetrija','div',7,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,'U',NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL);
