7bc21850c77e9eb16b44102f4a539d?s=96&d=monsterid&r=g\";s:12:\"display_name\";s:16:\"Takayuki Miyoshi\";}}s:8:\"requires\";s:3:\"5.7\";s:6:\"tested\";s:5:\"5.8.1\";s:12:\"requires_php\";b:0;s:6:\"rating\";i:82;s:7:\"ratings\";a:5:{i:5;i:1331;i:4;i:134;i:3;i:60;i:2;i:50;i:1;i:344;}s:11:\"num_ratings\";i:1919;s:15:\"support_threads\";i:444;s:24:\"support_threads_resolved\";i:130;s:15:\"active_installs\";i:5000000;s:12:\"last_updated\";s:21:\"2021-10-25 4:38am GMT\";s:5:\"added\";s:10:\"2007-08-02\";s:8:\"homepage\";s:25:\"https://contactform7.com/\";s:8:\"sections\";a:6:{s:11:\"description\";s:3131:\"<p>Contact Form 7 može upravljati s više obrazaca za kontakte, te još možete fleksibilno prilagoditi obrazac i sadržaj poruke jednostavnim oznakama. Obrazac podržava slanje AJAX-om, CAPTCHA, Akismet filtriranje spama i tako dalje.</p>\n<h4>Dokumentacija i podrška</h4>\n<p>Možete naći <a href=\"https://contactform7.com/docs/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">dokumentaciju</a>, <a href=\"https://contactform7.com/faq/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">FAQ</a> i više detaljnijih informacija o Contact Form 7 na <a href=\"https://contactform7.com/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">contactform7.com</a>. Ako niste uspjeli naći odgovor na svoje pitanje u FAQ ili u dokumentaciji, provjerite i <a href=\"https://wordpress.org/support/plugin/contact-form-7/\">forum podrške</a> na WordPress.org. Ako ne možete pronaći temu koja se odnosi na Vaše određeno pitanje, pokrenite novu temu.</p>\n<h4>Contact Form 7 treba tvoju podršku</h4>\n<p>Teško je nastaviti razvijati i podržavati ovaj besplatni dodatak bez donacija korisnika poput vas. Ako uživate koristeći Contact Form 7 i mislite da vam je od koristi, molimo razmislite o <a href=\"https://contactform7.com/donate/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\"><strong>donaciji</strong></a>. Vaša donacija potaknut će i podržati daljnji razvoj dodatka i bolju korisničku podršku.</p>\n<h4>Obavijesti o privatnosti</h4>\n<p>Sa zadanom konfiguracijom, sam po sebi, ovaj dodatak:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>ne prati korisnike potajno;</li>\n<li>ne zapisuje bilo koje osobne podatke korisnika u bazu podataka;</li>\n<li>ne šalje bilo koje podatke na vanjske poslužitelje;</li>\n<li>ne koristi kolačiće.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Ako aktivirate određene značajke u ovom dodatku, osobni podaci podnositelja kontakt obrasca, uključujući njihovu IP adresu, mogu se poslati pružatelju usluga. Stoga se preporučuje potvrđivanje pravila o privatnosti pružatelja usluge. Te značajke uključuju:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>reCAPTCHA (<a href=\"https://policies.google.com/?hl=en\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Google</a>)</li>\n<li>Akismet (<a href=\"https://automattic.com/privacy/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Automattic</a>)</li>\n<li>Constant Contact (<a href=\"https://www.endurance.com/privacy\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Endurance International Group</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.sendinblue.com/legal/privacypolicy/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Sendinblue</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://stripe.com/privacy\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Stripe</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h4>Preporučeni dodaci</h4>\n<p>Za korisnike Contact Form 7 preporučeni su sljedeći dodaci:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://wordpress.org/plugins/flamingo/\">Flamingo</a> od Takayuki Miyoshi &#8211; s Flamingom možete spremiti poslane poruke preko kontakt obrazaca u bazu podataka.</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://wordpress.org/plugins/bogo/\">Bogo</a> od Takayuki Miyoshi &#8211; Bogo je višejezični dodatak za izravno prosljeđivanje koji ne izaziva glavobolje.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>Prijevodi</h4>\n<p>Možete <a href=\"https://contactform7.com/translating-contact-form-7/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">prevesti Contact Form 7</a> na <a href=\"https://translate.wordpress.org/projects/wp-plugins/contact-form-7\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\"><strong>translate.wordpress.org</strong></a>.</p>\n\";s:12:\"installation\";s:468:\"<ol>\n<li>Prenesite cijelu <code>contact-form-7</code> mapu u <code>/wp-content/plugins/</code> direktorij.</li>\n<li>Aktivirajte dodatak preko <strong>Dodaci</strong> zaslona  (<strong>Dodaci &gt; Instalirani dodaci</strong>).</li>\n</ol>\n<p>Naći ćete <strong>Kontakt</strong> izbornik na svom WordPress administratorskom  zaslonu.</p>\n<p>Za osnovnu uporabu možete pogledati i <a href=\"https://contactform7.com/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">početnu stranicu dodatka</a>.</p>\n\";s:3:\"faq\";s:461:\"<p>Imate li pitanja ili problema s Contact Form 7? Koristite ove kanale za podršku na odgovarajući način.</p>\n<ol>\n<li><a href=\"https://contactform7.com/docs/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Dokumentacija</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://contactform7.com/faq/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">FAQ</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://wordpress.org/support/plugin/contact-form-7/\">Forum podrške</a></li>\n</ol>\n<p><a href=\"https://contactform7.com/support/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Podrška</a></p>\n\";s:9:\"changelog\";s:1069:\"<p>Za više informacija, pogledajte <a href=\"https://contactform7.com/category/releases/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">verzije izdanja</a>.</p>\n<h4>5.5.2</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>REST API: Removes argument schema reference that causes error when the form has &#8216;id&#8217; field.</li>\n<li>Changes method names that are reserved in PHP 5.6.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>5.5.1</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Fixed: Reserved keyword was used in PHP class constant name.</li>\n<li>Fixed: Uncaught TypeError on <code>in_array()</code> call.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>5.5</h4>\n<p><a href=\"https://contactform7.com/contact-form-7-55/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">https://contactform7.com/contact-form-7-55/</a></p>\n<h4>5.4.2</h4>\n<p><a href=\"https://contactform7.com/contact-form-7-542/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">https://contactform7.com/contact-form-7-542/</a></p>\n<h4>5.4.1</h4>\n<p><a href=\"https://contactform7.com/contact-form-7-541/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">https://contactform7.com/contact-form-7-541/</a></p>\n<h4>5.4</h4>\n<p><a href=\"https://contactform7.com/contact-form-7-54/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">https://contactform7.com/contact-form-7-54/</a></p>\n\";s:11:\"screenshots\";s:225:\"<ol><li><a href=\"https://ps.w.org/contact-form-7/assets/screenshot-1.png?rev=1176454\"><img src=\"https://ps.w.org/contact-form-7/assets/screenshot-1.png?rev=1176454\" alt=\"screenshot-1.png\"></a><p>screenshot-1.png</p></li></ol>\";s:7:\"reviews\";s:14516:\"<div class=\"review\">\n	<div class=\"review-head\">\n		<div class=\"reviewer-info\">\n			<div class=\"review-title-section\">\n				<h4 class=\"review-title\">It&#039;s good when it&#039;s working, but not if you need support</h4>\n				<div class=\"star-rating\">\n				<div class=\"wporg-ratings\" aria-label=\"2 od 5 zvjezdica\" data-title-template=\"%s od 5 zvjezdica\" data-rating=\"2\" style=\"color:#ffb900;\"><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-empty\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-empty\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-empty\"></span></div>				</div>\n			</div>\n			<p class=\"reviewer\">\n				Od <a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/sunlineenergy\"><img alt=\'\' src=\'https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/9b33b0f47d05d3875f9c7a4915c3fb69?s=16&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g\' srcset=\'https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/9b33b0f47d05d3875f9c7a4915c3fb69?s=32&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g 2x\' class=\'avatar avatar-16 photo\' height=\'16\' width=\'16\' loading=\'lazy\'/></a><a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/sunlineenergy\" class=\"reviewer-name\">Sunline Energy <small>(sunlineenergy)</small></a> na <span class=\"review-date\">25 listopada, 2021</span>			</p>\n		</div>\n	</div>\n	<div class=\"review-body\">Once the plugin was updated to 5.4.2 I started having issues with the recaptcha v3. All the forms are being flagged as spam. I\'ve already submitted a ticket but the author stopped responding. I jumped on a thread that had the same issue and the plugin author stopped responding as well. \nOther than that the plugin generally works well. Just make sure you don\'t have an issue because their support is very poor. </div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"review\">\n	<div class=\"review-head\">\n		<div class=\"reviewer-info\">\n			<div class=\"review-title-section\">\n				<h4 class=\"review-title\">it doesn&#039;t work</h4>\n				<div class=\"star-rating\">\n				<div class=\"wporg-ratings\" aria-label=\"1 od 5 zvjezdica\" data-title-template=\"%s od 5 zvjezdica\" data-rating=\"1\" style=\"color:#ffb900;\"><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-empty\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-empty\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-empty\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-empty\"></span></div>				</div>\n			</div>\n			<p class=\"reviewer\">\n				Od <a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/alexg79\"><img alt=\'\' src=\'https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/aeb8dfe5868aea7d738cc1bdc95d9cda?s=16&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g\' srcset=\'https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/aeb8dfe5868aea7d738cc1bdc95d9cda?s=32&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g 2x\' class=\'avatar avatar-16 photo\' height=\'16\' width=\'16\' loading=\'lazy\'/></a><a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/alexg79\" class=\"reviewer-name\">alexg79</a> na <span class=\"review-date\">25 listopada, 2021</span>			</p>\n		</div>\n	</div>\n	<div class=\"review-body\">I have just downloaded and integrated it with my Mailchimp list but when I Have tested it by signing in as a user on my contact web page it keeps saying : \n\"There has been some error while submitting the form. Please verify all form fields again.\"\nPlease let me know if I can solve this issue.\nThanks in advance !\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"review\">\n	<div class=\"review-head\">\n		<div class=\"reviewer-info\">\n			<div class=\"review-title-section\">\n				<h4 class=\"review-title\">White page on 5.5</h4>\n				<div class=\"star-rating\">\n				<div class=\"wporg-ratings\" aria-label=\"5 od 5 zvjezdica\" data-title-template=\"%s od 5 zvjezdica\" data-rating=\"5\" style=\"color:#ffb900;\"><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span></div>				</div>\n			</div>\n			<p class=\"reviewer\">\n				Od <a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/deegee65\"><img alt=\'\' src=\'https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/d417b15caebb449083cf33a19975e9da?s=16&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g\' srcset=\'https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/d417b15caebb449083cf33a19975e9da?s=32&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g 2x\' class=\'avatar avatar-16 photo\' height=\'16\' width=\'16\' loading=\'lazy\'/></a><a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/deegee65\" class=\"reviewer-name\">deegee65</a> na <span class=\"review-date\">11 listopada, 2021</span>			</p>\n		</div>\n	</div>\n	<div class=\"review-body\">I try to view the contact modules but i receive white page.\nPhp 8 - Latest WP</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"review\">\n	<div class=\"review-head\">\n		<div class=\"reviewer-info\">\n			<div class=\"review-title-section\">\n				<h4 class=\"review-title\">Does not work on mobile devices</h4>\n				<div class=\"star-rating\">\n				<div class=\"wporg-ratings\" aria-label=\"1 od 5 zvjezdica\" data-title-template=\"%s od 5 zvjezdica\" data-rating=\"1\" style=\"color:#ffb900;\"><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-empty\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-empty\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-empty\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-empty\"></span></div>				</div>\n			</div>\n			<p class=\"reviewer\">\n				Od <a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/nathaniel45\"><img alt=\'\' src=\'https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/bef6a799e702b20f1cc71ac1a2e313ef?s=16&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g\' srcset=\'https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/bef6a799e702b20f1cc71ac1a2e313ef?s=32&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g 2x\' class=\'avatar avatar-16 photo\' height=\'16\' width=\'16\' loading=\'lazy\'/></a><a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/nathaniel45\" class=\"reviewer-name\">nathaniel45</a> na <span class=\"review-date\">9 listopada, 2021</span>			</p>\n		</div>\n	</div>\n	<div class=\"review-body\">Does not work on mobile devices.</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"review\">\n	<div class=\"review-head\">\n		<div class=\"reviewer-info\">\n			<div class=\"review-title-section\">\n				<h4 class=\"review-title\">normal</h4>\n				<div class=\"star-rating\">\n				<div class=\"wporg-ratings\" aria-label=\"4 od 5 zvjezdica\" data-title-template=\"%s od 5 zvjezdica\" data-rating=\"4\" style=\"color:#ffb900;\"><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-empty\"></span></div>				</div>\n			</div>\n			<p class=\"reviewer\">\n				Od <a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/worage\"><img alt=\'\' src=\'https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/d52a0a29e8a174aa8385d9e6fae4bb60?s=16&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g\' srcset=\'https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/d52a0a29e8a174aa8385d9e6fae4bb60?s=32&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g 2x\' class=\'avatar avatar-16 photo\' height=\'16\' width=\'16\' loading=\'lazy\'/></a><a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/worage\" class=\"reviewer-name\">worage</a> na <span class=\"review-date\">6 listopada, 2021</span>			</p>\n		</div>\n	</div>\n	<div class=\"review-body\">基本的な機能は充実しているものの、それ以上のクオリティを期待できない部分は残念。</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"review\">\n	<div class=\"review-head\">\n		<div class=\"reviewer-info\">\n			<div class=\"review-title-section\">\n				<h4 class=\"review-title\">Good but More Scope of Improvement</h4>\n				<div class=\"star-rating\">\n				<div class=\"wporg-ratings\" aria-label=\"3 od 5 zvjezdica\" data-title-template=\"%s od 5 zvjezdica\" data-rating=\"3\" style=\"color:#ffb900;\"><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-empty\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-empty\"></span></div>				</div>\n			</div>\n			<p class=\"reviewer\">\n				Od <a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/srinivas08\"><img alt=\'\' src=\'https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/7ee226585d77b89eedaa470b8ae210db?s=16&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g\' srcset=\'https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/7ee226585d77b89eedaa470b8ae210db?s=32&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g 2x\' class=\'avatar avatar-16 photo\' height=\'16\' width=\'16\' loading=\'lazy\'/></a><a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/srinivas08\" class=\"reviewer-name\">srinivas08</a> na <span class=\"review-date\">4 listopada, 2021</span>			</p>\n		</div>\n	</div>\n	<div class=\"review-body\">The form is too simple, it cant be added directly, mostly it needs some css to make it work. If we use WPForms, it has good frontend design, CF7 is just like a skeleton of form. And on most sites it throws 409 conflict error as the response code.</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"review\">\n	<div class=\"review-head\">\n		<div class=\"reviewer-info\">\n			<div class=\"review-title-section\">\n				<h4 class=\"review-title\">Pretty easy to use and it&#039;s free!</h4>\n				<div class=\"star-rating\">\n				<div class=\"wporg-ratings\" aria-label=\"5 od 5 zvjezdica\" data-title-template=\"%s od 5 zvjezdica\" data-rating=\"5\" style=\"color:#ffb900;\"><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span></div>				</div>\n			</div>\n			<p class=\"reviewer\">\n				Od <a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/westerngeomancy\"><img alt=\'\' src=\'https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a70f64fe24b26e55f5d6846231053f7a?s=16&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g\' srcset=\'https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a70f64fe24b26e55f5d6846231053f7a?s=32&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g 2x\' class=\'avatar avatar-16 photo\' height=\'16\' width=\'16\' loading=\'lazy\'/></a><a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/westerngeomancy\" class=\"reviewer-name\">westerngeomancy</a> na <span class=\"review-date\">25 listopada, 2021</span>			</p>\n		</div>\n	</div>\n	<div class=\"review-body\">I was having trouble with Jetpack messing up anything more complicated than a basic contact form and looked at a few other plugins, all of which required subscription. I had thought CF7 seemed a bit complicated, but once  you get your head around the tags formatting, it\'s really very easy to use, and very versatile; which encouraged me to set up even more complicated forms than I\'d previously used. \nAn excellent and essential plugin, huge thanks to the developer.</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"review\">\n	<div class=\"review-head\">\n		<div class=\"reviewer-info\">\n			<div class=\"review-title-section\">\n				<h4 class=\"review-title\">VERY SIMPLE!</h4>\n				<div class=\"star-rating\">\n				<div class=\"wporg-ratings\" aria-label=\"5 od 5 zvjezdica\" data-title-template=\"%s od 5 zvjezdica\" data-rating=\"5\" style=\"color:#ffb900;\"><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span></div>				</div>\n			</div>\n			<p class=\"reviewer\">\n				Od <a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/sekedus\"><img alt=\'\' src=\'https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/5bdfd57621a90bd45a52382c7c6a713a?s=16&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g\' srcset=\'https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/5bdfd57621a90bd45a52382c7c6a713a?s=32&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g 2x\' class=\'avatar avatar-16 photo\' height=\'16\' width=\'16\' loading=\'lazy\'/></a><a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/sekedus\" class=\"reviewer-name\">sekedus</a> na <span class=\"review-date\">12 rujna, 2021</span>			</p>\n		</div>\n	</div>\n	<div class=\"review-body\">Lite &amp; Simple.</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"review\">\n	<div class=\"review-head\">\n		<div class=\"reviewer-info\">\n			<div class=\"review-title-section\">\n				<h4 class=\"review-title\">Awesome as always</h4>\n				<div class=\"star-rating\">\n				<div class=\"wporg-ratings\" aria-label=\"5 od 5 zvjezdica\" data-title-template=\"%s od 5 zvjezdica\" data-rating=\"5\" style=\"color:#ffb900;\"><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span></div>				</div>\n			</div>\n			<p class=\"reviewer\">\n				Od <a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/bagerathan\"><img alt=\'\' src=\'https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/facab8c3cf5b8bc543eed919ed5d55c0?s=16&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g\' srcset=\'https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/facab8c3cf5b8bc543eed919ed5d55c0?s=32&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g 2x\' class=\'avatar avatar-16 photo\' height=\'16\' width=\'16\' loading=\'lazy\'/></a><a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/bagerathan\" class=\"reviewer-name\">Bage <small>(bagerathan)</small></a> na <span class=\"review-date\">6 rujna, 2021</span>			</p>\n		</div>\n	</div>\n	<div class=\"review-body\">I always use either Contact form 7 or Caldera forms to create forms. Now the caldera forms see the sunset, Contact form 7 is going to be my life safer. </div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"review\">\n	<div class=\"review-head\">\n		<div class=\"reviewer-info\">\n			<div class=\"review-title-section\">\n				<h4 class=\"review-title\">Amazing plugin!</h4>\n				<div class=\"star-rating\">\n				<div class=\"wporg-ratings\" aria-label=\"5 od 5 zvjezdica\" data-title-template=\"%s od 5 zvjezdica\" data-rating=\"5\" style=\"color:#ffb900;\"><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span></div>				</div>\n			</div>\n			<p class=\"reviewer\">\n				Od <a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/dongphuchaitrieu\"><img alt=\'\' src=\'https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/cd80677e837b5de940763dd334c2d8b8?s=16&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g\' srcset=\'https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/cd80677e837b5de940763dd334c2d8b8?s=32&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g 2x\' class=\'avatar avatar-16 photo\' height=\'16\' width=\'16\' loading=\'lazy\'/></a><a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/dongphuchaitrieu\" class=\"reviewer-name\">Đồng Phục Hải Triều <small>(dongphuchaitrieu)</small></a> na <span class=\"review-date\">3 rujna, 2021</span>			</p>\n		</div>\n	</div>\n	<div class=\"review-body\">All my websites are using CF7 🌍</div>\n</div>\n\";}s:13:\"download_link\";s:63:\"https://downloads.wordpress.org/plugin/contact-form-7.5.5.2.zip\";s:11:\"screenshots\";a:1:{i:1;a:2:{s:3:\"src\";s:67:\"https://ps.w.org/contact-form-7/assets/screenshot-1.png?rev=1176454\";s:7:\"caption\";s:16:\"screenshot-1.png\";}}s:4:\"tags\";a:5:{s:7:\"contact\";s:7:\"contact\";s:12:\"contact-form\";s:12:\"contact form\";s:5:\"email\";s:5:\"email\";s:8:\"feedback\";s:8:\"feedback\";s:4:\"form\";s:4:\"form\";}s:8:\"versions\";a:154:{s:3:\"1.1\";s:61:\"https://downloads.wordpress.org/plugin/contact-form-7.1.1.zip\";s:4:\"1.10\";s:62:\"https://downloads.wordpress.org/plugin/contact-form-7.1.10.zip\