0/rotacijski-volumen.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"265\" data-link=\"http://smotra.pbf.hr/?attachment_id=265\" class=\"wp-image-265\"/><figcaption class=\"blocks-gallery-item__caption\"><font size=\"+1\">Volumen rotacijskog tijela</font></figcaption></figure></li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><img src=\"http://smotra.pbf.hr/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/fizika-2.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"731\" data-full-url=\"http://smotra.pbf.hr/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/fizika-2.jpg\" data-link=\"http://smotra.pbf.hr/?attachment_id=731\" class=\"wp-image-731\"/><figcaption class=\"blocks-gallery-item__caption\"><font size=\"+1\">Entropija</font></figcaption></figure></li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><img src=\"http://smotra.pbf.hr/wp-content/uploads/2021/10/bin_norm.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"154\" data-link=\"http://smotra.pbf.hr/?attachment_id=154\" class=\"wp-image-154\"/><figcaption class=\"blocks-gallery-item__caption\"><font size=\"+1\">Statističke distribucije</font></figcaption></figure></li></ul></figure>\n<!-- /wp:gallery -->\n\n<!-- wp:gallery {\"ids\":[638,639,729,730],\"columns\":4,\"imageCrop\":false,\"linkTo\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery columns-4\"><ul class=\"blocks-gallery-grid\"><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><img src=\"http://smotra.pbf.hr/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/dna-1024x811.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"638\" data-link=\"http://smotra.pbf.hr/?attachment_id=638\" class=\"wp-image-638\"/><figcaption class=\"blocks-gallery-item__caption\"><font size=\"+1\">Izolacija DNA iz kukuruza i luka</font></figcaption></figure></li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><img src=\"http://smotra.pbf.hr/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/grah.png\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"639\" data-link=\"http://smotra.pbf.hr/?attachment_id=639\" class=\"wp-image-639\"/><figcaption class=\"blocks-gallery-item__caption\"><font size=\"+1\">Škrobna zrnca graha</font></figcaption></figure></li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><img src=\"http://smotra.p