e-1835\"/></figure></li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><img src=\"http://smotra.pbf.hr/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/viro_large.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"1836\" data-link=\"http://smotra.pbf.hr/?attachment_id=1836\" class=\"wp-image-1836\"/></figure></li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><img src=\"http://smotra.pbf.hr/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/vita_lab_nova_large.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"1837\" data-link=\"http://smotra.pbf.hr/?attachment_id=1837\" class=\"wp-image-1837\"/></figure></li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><img src=\"http://smotra.pbf.hr/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/zagrebacka_pivovara_large.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"1838\" data-link=\"http://smotra.pbf.hr/?attachment_id=1838\" class=\"wp-image-1838\"/></figure></li></ul></figure>\n<!-- /wp:gallery -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','O nama','','inherit','closed','closed','','2-revision-v1','','','2024-10-27 10:13:36','2024-10-27 09:13:36','',2,'https://smotra.pbf.hr/?p=1885',0,'revision','',0),(1887,1,'2024-10-27 10:14:02','2024-10-27 09:14:02','<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\",\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"20.1px\"}}} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\" style=\"font-size:20.1px\">Prehrambeno-biotehnološki fakultet Sveučilišta u Zagrebu je <strong>vodeća znanstvenoistraživačka i nastavna institucija</strong> u Republici Hrvatskoj u području <strong>biotehnologije, prehrambene tehnologije i nutricionizma</strong>. Dugogodišnja djelatnost Fakulteta u <strong>obrazovanju</strong> visokokvalitetnog stručnog kadra te izvođenje <strong>znanstvenoistraživačkih i stručnih projekata</strong> u suradnji s <strong>gospodarstvom</strong> bila je i ostala glavni <strong>pokretač razvoja</strong> hrvatskog gospodarstva u navedenom području djelovanja.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":40} -->\n<div style=\"height:40px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"align\":\"center\",\"id\":1845,\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"custom\",\"className\":\"is-style-default\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-image is-style-default\"><figure class=\"aligncenter size-full\"><a href=\"http://www.pbf.unizg.hr/\"><img src=\"http://smotra.pbf.hr/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/2_1.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1845\"/></a><figcaption><strong><span class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-red-color\">PBF poveznica</span></strong></figcaption></figure></div>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":40} -->\n<div style=\"height:40px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"align\":\"center\",\"id\":1878,\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"className\":\"is-style-default\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-image is-style-default\"><figure class=\"aligncenter size-full\"><img src=\"http://smotra.pbf.hr/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/Adobe-Scan-23-Oct-2024-1-1.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1878\"/></figure></div>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":40} -->\n<div style=\"height:40px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:html -->\n<p style=\"font-size:30px\" align=\"center\">Posjetite štand PBF-a i budite jedni od <span style=\"color: #ff0000\">500 sretnika</span> koji mogu besplatno isprobati <span style=\"color: #0000ff\">LABSTER virtualni laboratorij</span> doma na vlastitom računalu</p>\n<!-- /wp:html -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"align\":\"center\",\"id\":1866,\"width\":256,\"height\":256,\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\"><figure class=\"aligncenter size-full is-resized\"><img src=\"http://smotra.pbf.hr/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/qrchimpX4096-5-2.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1866\" width=\"256\" height=\"256\"/><figcaption><a rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" href=\"https://www.labster.com/\" data-type=\"URL\" data-id=\"https://www.labster.com/\" target=\"_blank\"><strong><span class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-red-color\">https://www.labster.com/</span></strong></a></figcaption></figure></div>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":45} -->\n<div style=\"height:45px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"level\":1} -->\n<h1 class=\"has-text-align-center\"><strong>Smještaj fakulteta</strong></h1>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\",\"fontSize\":\"medium\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center has-medium-font-size\">Prehrambeno–biotehnološki fakultet nalazi se u&nbsp;<strong>Pierottijevoj ulici br. 6</strong>&nbsp;u Zagrebu, a zgradu dijeli s Rudarsko–geološko–naftnim fakultetom.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\",\"fontSize\":\"medium\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center has-medium-font-size\">Osim u glavnoj zgradi, nastava se održava i u susjednim zgradama, u ulici A. Kačića–Miošića i u ulici I. Kršnjavoga, a nastava iz fizike na Fakultetu elektrotehnike i računarstva u Unskoj ulici.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\",\"fontSize\":\"medium\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center has-medium-font-size\">Fakultet je smješten gotovo u samom središtu grada, a u blizini se nalaze Rektorat Sveučilišta, Hrvatsko narodno kazalište, Muzej Mimara, Studentski centar i nekoliko fakulteta.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"align\":\"center\",\"id\":1769,\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\"><figure class=\"aligncenter size-full\"><img src=\"http://smotra.pbf.hr/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/pbf_lokacija_large.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1769\"/></figure></div>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"level\":1} -->\n<h1 class=\"has-text-align-center\"><strong>LEGENDA:</strong></h1>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true,\"fontSize\":\"medium\"} -->\n<ol class=\"has-medium-font-size\"><li>&nbsp;<strong>PBF (glavna zgrada),&nbsp;</strong>Pierottijeva 6<ul><li>Društvo prehrambenih tehnologa, biotehnologa i nutricionista (Društvo PBN)</li><li>Šahovski klub “ELO-PBF”</li><li>Biotehnička zaklada PBF-a</li></ul></li><li>&nbsp;<strong>PBF,&nbsp;</strong>Kačićeva 28 i 30<ul><li>Laboratorij za biokemijsko inženjerstvo, industrijsku mikrobiologiju i tehnologiju piva i slada</li><li>Laboratorij za tehnologiju, primjenu stanica i biotransformaciju</li></ul></li><li>&nbsp;<strong>PBF,&nbsp;</strong>Kršnjavoga 25<ul><li>Laboratorij za biologiju i genetiku mikroorganizama</li></ul></li><li>&nbsp;<strong>PBF</strong><ul><li>Regionalna knjižnica</li><li>Računovodstvo</li><li>Sportska dvorana</li><li>Sveučilišno sportsko društvo PBF</li></ul></li><li>&nbsp;<strong>Fakultet elektrotehnike i računarstva,&nbsp;</strong>Unska ulica 3</li><li>&nbsp;<strong>PBF</strong>, Jagićeva 31<ul><li>Centar za kontrolu namirnica</li></ul></li><li>&nbsp;<strong>Sveučilište u Zagrebu,&nbsp;</strong>Trg maršala Tita 14<br>(nova lokacije je Ulica Radoslava Cimermana 88, SEECEL, Kajzerica)<ul><li>Rektorat</li></ul></li><li>&nbsp;<strong>Studentski centar</strong>, Savska cesta 25</li></ol>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:html -->\n<p align=\"center\">&lt;<iframe src=\"https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d2781.2207448878953!2d15.961707376107238!3d45.8068373105124!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x4765d6ef7e51eee7%3A0x94a8412f83a7eaf3!2sPrehrambeno-biotehnolo%C5%A1ki%20fakultet!5e0!3m2!1shr!2shr!4v1729677041358!5m2!1shr!2shr\" width=\"600\" height=\"450\" style=\"border:0;\" allowfullscreen=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer-when-downgrade\"></iframe></p>\n<!-- /wp:html -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":60} -->\n<div style=\"height:60px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\",\"fontSize\":\"large\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center has-large-font-size\"><strong>Kamo poslije fakulteta?</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\",\"fontSize\":\"large\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center has-large-font-size\">Neke organizacije u kojima se zapošljavaju&nbsp;stručnjaci koji završavaju Prehrambeno-biotehnološki fakultet.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:gallery {\"ids\":[1782,1783,1784,1785,1786,1787,1788,1789,1790,1791,1792,1793,1794,1795,1796,1797,1798,1799,1800,1801,1802,1803,1804,1805,1806,1807,1808,1809,1810,1811,1812,1813,1814,1815,1816,1817,1818,1819,1820,1821,1822,1823,1824,1825,1826,1827,1828,1829,1830,1831,1832,1833,1834,1835,1836,1837,1838],\"columns\":6,\"imageCrop\":false,\"linkTo\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery columns-6\"><ul class=\"blocks-gallery-grid\"><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><img src=\"http://smotra.pbf.hr/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/agrionoca_large.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"1782\" data-link=\"http://smotra.pbf.hr/?attachment_id=1782\" class=\"wp-image-1782\"/></figure></li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><img src=\"http://smotra.pbf.hr/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/anamarija_large.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"1783\" data-link=\"http://smotra.pbf.hr/?attachment_id=1783\" class=\"wp-image-1783\"/></figure></li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><img src=\"http://smotra.pbf.hr/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/atlantic_large.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"1784\" data-link=\"http://smotra.pbf.hr/?attachment_id=1784\" class=\"wp-image-1784\"/></figure></li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><img src=\"http://smotra.pbf.hr/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/badel_large.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"1785\" data-link=\"http://smotra.pbf.hr/?attachment_id=1785\" class=\"wp-image-1785\"/></figure></li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><img src=\"http://smotra.pbf.hr/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/bavaria_large.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"1786\" data-link=\"http://smotra.pbf.hr/?attachment_id=1786\" 